[00:04.62]This feeling is a covenant
[00:08.37]A conflagration that’s eminent
[00:11.62]This soul abounds around the continent
[00:15.40]And you spend so long on what you think it meant
[00:18.40][01:20.52][01:47.20][01:54.90][02:03.14][02:10.68][02:19.33][02:29.70]
[00:20.92]I can see it now up in the sky
[00:24.67]This ain't a warning, it is a sign
[00:28.43]I can feel it now all in my heart
[00:32.22]This revolution about to start
[00:34.82] 
[00:50.07]My anger is an avalanche
[00:53.77]Your sadness is a broken branch
[00:57.14]But what we need is less of tidal waves
[01:00.80]And more of peace and love and better ways
[01:04.17][02:01.01][02:17.45](Ooh-ooh-ooh)
[01:06.35]I can see it now around the world
[01:10.11]As love will start to be unfurled
[01:13.76]And every cause for hate and greed
[01:17.62]Will never thrive and always leave
[01:39.02]She came to me in a dream
[01:53.17][02:08.09][02:24.30]Skygirl
